{title: 060 - Blessed Jesus at Thy Word}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #060 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 60}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Blessed [D]Jesus, [G]at [Em]Thy [D]word,
[Em]We are [C]gath[G]ered [Am]all [G]to [Dsus]hear [D7][G]Thee;
[G]Let our [D]hearts and [G]souls [Em]be [D]stirred,
[Em]Now to [C]seek [G]and [Am]love [G]and [Dsus]fear [D7][G]Thee.
[G]By[D] Thy [Em]teach[D]ings [G]sweet [A]and [D]holy,
[G]Dra[Em]wn from [D]earth [G]to [Am]love [Em]Thee [Am7]sole[D7] [G]ly.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]All [D]our [G]knowledge, [Em]sense, [D]and sight,
[Em][C]Lie [G][Am]in [G]deepest [Dsus][D7]darkness [G]shrouded;
[G]Till [D]Thy [G]Spirit [Em]breaks [D]our night,
[Em][C]With [G]His [Am]beams [G][Dsus]of [D7]truth [G]unclouded.
[G]He [D]alone [Em]to [D]God [G]canst [A]win [D]us,
[G][Em]He [D]who [G]works [Am][Em]all [Am7]good [D7]within [G]us.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Glorious [D]Lord, [G]Thy [Em]self [D]impart!
[Em][C]Light [G]of [Am]light, [G][Dsus]from [D7]God [G]proceeding.
[G]Open [D]Thou [G]our [Em]ears [D]and heart
[Em][C]Help [G]us, [Am]by [G][Dsus]Thy [D7]Spirit's [G]pleading.
[G][D]Hear [Em]the [D]cry [G]Thy [A]people [D]raises!
[G][Em]Hear, [D]and [G]bless [Am][Em]our [Am7]prayer [D7]and [G]praises!
{end_of_verse}
